<PageShell title="About Us" description="About How2Tech: a technology publication that explains how things work in plain language.">
<p>How2Tech is a technology publication built around one idea: <strong>Technology. Explained. Simplified.</strong></p>
<p>We write step-by-step guides, plain-language explainers and tool roundups for readers who want to understand the devices, apps and services they use every day.</p>
<h2>What we cover</h2>
<ul><li><a href="/category/technology/">Technology</a>: hardware, software and the ideas behind them.</li><li><a href="/category/gaming/">Gaming</a>: gaming news, features and guides for the games and platforms you play.</li><li><a href="/category/how-to/">How-To</a>: practical guides to fix and set up things.</li><li><a href="/category/ai-tools/">AI &amp; Tools</a>: tools and websites worth your time.</li><li><a href="/category/internet-security/">Internet &amp; Security</a>: staying private and safe online.</li><li><a href="/category/explained/">Explained</a>: concepts without the jargon.</li></ul>
<h2>Editorial standards</h2>
<p>We aim to be accurate, say clearly when something depends on your device or software version, and update articles when things change. If you spot a mistake, please <a href="/contact/">let us know</a>.</p>
